{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34184","headline":"杂讽九首 九 · 陆龟蒙","name":"杂讽九首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝爲壮士歌，暮爲壮士歌。\n壮士心独苦，傍人谓之何。\n古铁久不快，倚天无处磨。\n将来易水上，犹足生寒波。\n捷可搏飞狖，健能超槖駞。\n羣儿被坚利，索手安冯河。\n惊飙扫长林，直木谢𬄭科\n严霜冻大泽，僵龙不如蛇。\n昔者天血碧，吾徒安叹嗟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}